WEBVTT

00:06:59.497 --> 00:07:01.930
[How can you deal with shame that you feel

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:04.430
for not measuring up to expectations?]

00:07:04.463 --> 00:07:09.063
Yes, I guess it depends
whose expectations you're thinking of.

00:07:09.097 --> 00:07:11.930
If it's our own expectations,

00:07:11.963 --> 00:07:15.830
maybe they weren't realistic,

00:07:15.863 --> 00:07:18.463
or maybe we expected too much.

00:07:18.497 --> 00:07:22.797
I think that in this world now,
which moves so fast,

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.063
I mean -- everybody's overloaded.

00:07:25.097 --> 00:07:27.963
There's something wrong there!

00:07:27.997 --> 00:07:30.797
About measuring up
to other people's expectation,